<view class="page"><view class="field" wx:if="{{!ready}}"><text class="label">邀请口令</text><input class="input" placeholder="粘贴邀请口令" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{token}}" bindinput="onToken" /><view class="btn" bindtap="load">打开</view></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><text class="title">{{productCode}}</text><text class="sub">先填裁剪总数，再按尺码填件数。加起来要等于总数。</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">裁剪总数</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="填写裁剪总数" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{totalQty}}" bindinput="onTotal" /></view><view class="field"><text class="label">尺码件数</text><view class="ratio-grid"><view class="ratio-col" wx:for="{{sizeRows}}" wx:key="index"><input class="input size-name" placeholder="尺码" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{item.size}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onSize" /><text class="ratio-x" wx:if="{{sizeRows.length > 1}}" data-index="{{index}}" catchtap="onRemove">×</text><input class="input" type="number" placeholder="件数" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{item.ratio}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onQty" /></view><text class="ratio-add" bindtap="onAdd">+</text></view><text class="sub">上排写尺码，下排写这个尺码裁了几件。各尺码件数加起来要等于裁剪总数。</text><text class="total" wx:if="{{sizeRatioText}}">{{sizeRatioText}}</text></view><view class="btn" bindtap="onSubmit">提交件数</view><view class="btn" bindtap="onPhoto">拍照上传裁剪单</view></block></view>
